ACT XIV OF 1996
BAQAI MEDICAL UNIVERSITY ACT, 1996
An Act to provide for the
establishment of a Medical University known as the Baqai Medical University,
Karachi
[Gazette of Sindh, Extraordinary Part-IV, 26th May, 1996]
No. PAS/Legis-B-4/96, dated 26-5-1996.---The
Baqai Medical University Bill, 1996 having been passed by the Provincial
Assembly of Sindh on 8th April, 1996 and assented to by the Governor of Sindh
on 15th May, 1996 is hereby published as an Act of the Legislature of Sindh.
CHAPTER-IV
AUTHORITIES OF THE UNIVERSITY
16. Authorities.--The following shall be the Authorities of the
University:---
(i) the Board of Governors
(ii) the Academic Council;
(iii) the Boards of Faculties;
(iv) the Board of Advanced
Studies and Research;
(v) the Boards of Studies;
(vi) the Selection Board;
(vii) the Finance and Planning
Committee;
(viii) the Affiliation Committee;
(ix) the Discipline Committee;
(x) the Works Committee;
(xi) the Sports Control Board;
and
(xii) such other Authorities as
may be prescribed
